    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 2 of the Drug Dependant Persons (Treatment and Rehabilitation) Act,No. 54 of 2007, read with the provisions of the Constitution, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka, on the recommendation of the National Dangerous Drug Control Board, do by this Order, designatethe place specified in the Schedule hereto be a Treatment and Rehabilitation Centre for the purpose of providing care andrehabilitation to drug dependant persons.",
